      "section": "5",
      "section_title": "A2 -- the exhibit, and the loop that repairs it",
      "shows": "The beat flow M0 -> M5 -> L1 … L6, each beat carrying its status and its one decisive number, over an account strip of environment actions spent. At M5 the manual replays the play record at 100%, Lean signs an axiom-free `unsolvable` theorem, and the world contradicts it -- the co-occurrence of those three facts is the whole DC22 phenomenon.",
